{start_of_verse: Verse 9}
There's [G]buckwheat cakes and Injun batter,
[C]Makes you fat or a little fatter,
Look [G]away! Look [Em]away! Look [D]away!
Dixie [G]Land.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 10}
Then [G]hoe it down and scratch your gravel,
[C]To Dixie's Land I'm bound to travel,
Look [G]away! Look [Em]away! Look [D]away!
Dixie [G]Land.
{end_of_verse}

